flowchart TD
    A[Caller requests popup menu] --> B[Create or reuse GWE_MENU model]
    B --> C[Measure items and compute popup geometry]
    C --> D[Create popup GWE_WINDOW]
    D --> E[Set capture to popup window]
    E --> F[Enter menu tracking loop]

    F --> G{Incoming event}
    G -->|Pointer move inside menu| H[Update highlighted item]
    G -->|Pointer up on command| I[Execute command]
    G -->|Pointer on submenu item| J[Open or arm submenu]
    G -->|Pointer outside menu| K[Dismiss popup tree]
    G -->|Key up or down| L[Move selection]
    G -->|Enter| I
    G -->|Escape| K

    H --> F
    J --> F
    L --> F

    I --> M{Return command mode?}
    M -->|Yes| N[Store command id for caller]
    M -->|No| O[Send command notification to owner window]
    N --> P[Dismiss popup tree]
    O --> P

    K --> Q{Outside click pending?}
    P --> R[Release capture]
    Q -->|Yes| S[Replay click to underlying target]
    Q -->|No| R
    S --> R
    R --> T[Destroy popup window or cascade]
    T --> U[Exit menu loop]
